                                "sense_id": "9ebc836c-daeb-361e-8b70-8fe98ac96ac5",
                                "text": "For as for the firſt kynde of eleccion, after whiche, Chriſte hathe choſen bys catholike churche out of the Jewes and Gentiles, to be his church here in earth: in thys kynde are there penitentes and impenitentes bothe."
